{"detail": {"templateUuid": "d1c651a6b6b9459c9a916b942a86f7e6", "projectUuid": "d20a5f76aff04d778e868f72cf3ac5b5", "name": "历史题材AAA级游戏《战国风云》", "description": "一款以战国史诗为背景题材的 AAA级魂类 + RPG 游戏3分钟 DEMO，突然炸穿国外各大社区平台。\n\t\n据传，这支互动影视级 DEMO 由杭州一家 「不记名」影视游戏工作室，在 172795秒 的极限打磨中硬生生推了出来。\n\t\n更离谱的是，消息才刚放出，海外讨论度已经开始一路飙升。\n不少人都在问：这到底是哪来的团队，怎么突然就把战国题材狠狠干到了这个级别。\n\t\n而据 万物灵汐 相关知情人士透露，\n这支作品的全球首发日期，预计已经定档：2027年4月1日\n游戏主题专辑MV相关CG已于2026年4月23日公开\n\t\n如果这消息最终坐实，\n那这很可能不是一次普通的新作曝光，\n而是国产战国题材，第一次真正意义上朝着 AAA级大作 正面开火。", "coverUrl": "/assets/55e33ed7b7a4161a.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/edd8e67e9cba4d5babee74b681f3df9d/a2ab9df94258782ce5930208d597c03473754c71.mp4", "snapshotId": 7424, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 6501656, "ownerUuid": "edd8e67e9cba4d5babee74b681f3df9d", "avatar": "/assets/c5a51c42b206e1f5.webp", "nickname": "法兰西泥瓦匠", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 163, "tags": [{"id": 3031, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "大乱斗｜vol.1 显形记", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3031/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3034, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "3-创意与超现实", "parentTag": 3031, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3031/3034", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1302, "code": "game_art", "tagLabel": "游戏美宣", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1302/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/69ea382a000000001901e005?xsec_token=ABIfL12riXbAszYhUa3M7i1ZyaeyqlfvuhLE_KDo-hA-M=&xsec_source=pc_user", "createAt": "2026年04月25日 14:22", "updateAt": "2026年05月11日 22:38", "publishAt": "2026年04月25日 14:22", "playCount": 72, "viewCreationProcessCount": 26, "copyCanvasCount": 4, "shareCount": 0